rvice/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":2321960,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"},{"game_id":"steam-2321960","metric":"demo_ccu","observed_at":"2026-10-26T07:31:50Z","value":130,"status":"ok","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/ISteamUserStats/GetNumberOfCurrentPlayers/v1/?appid=4422420","error_code":null}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-2321960-1846651706692019","game_id":"steam-2321960","kind":"announcement","title":"Enjoy the Spirit Crossing demo TODAY during Steam Next Fest!","summary":"We’re launching Spirit Crossing later this year, so now’s your last chance to hop in for free, get acquainted with the game's features, meet some little square bears (and of course, people too), and let us know what you think! 🪧 NOTE: All your demo progress *will* transfer at launch! 📨 Looking to invite a friend? Check out our recruit codes! Generate an Invite Code from the starting screen by clicking on \"Recruit Friends\". In-game, you can do this from the main menu under \"Recruit\". You can also","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T18:01:53Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692019","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2321960-1844751498222113","game_id":"steam-2321960","kind":"update","title":"15.4 Update: Feast of Bears 🐻","summary":"Greetings, wanderers! The 15.4 update is here, and it brings exciting changes including the Feast of Bears seasonal event, a revamp of waystations’ crafting stations and recipes, improvements to tournaments rewards and the pickaxe harvesting mechanic, brand new flairs so you can express yourself and show a lot more of your personality to others, and more! View the 15.4 trailer and check out the list of changes below:Feast of BearsThe leaves are falling in the Crosslands, which means we’re approa","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-24T16:44:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498222113","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2321960-1843481262696140","game_id":"steam-2321960","kind":"announcement","title":"Temporary closure of new Steam playtest sign-ups","summary":"Hello and happy Friday, wanderers!We wanted to give you a heads up: we're doing some changes that require us to temporarily close Steam open playtest sign-ups. Starting September 14, sign-ups will be closed to new participants.Don't worry - this won't have any impact on you if the game is already installed on your device or added to your Steam library! The playtest sign-up button simply won't be visible on our Steam page for a few days.We anticipate this shouldn't take longer than a week, and we","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T18:31:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696140","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2321960-1841579228663268","game_id":"steam-2321960","kind":"update","title":"15.3 Update: Sky Fish Summer ☁️🎣","summary":"15.3 Update: Sky Fish Summer!The 15.3 update includes new Wilderness activities (like Sky Fishing!) several economy balancing changes, changes to Quests, improvements to the Beacon Charges UX, and many quality of life improvements. Also, for those who might have missed it, we’ve been keeping the community up to date on our Monetization Plans. We previously shared some blog posts that explain in detail what our challenges are, and how we plan to make the game sustainable in the long run. Then, la","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-19T16:54:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228663268","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2321960-1839676055886405","game_id":"steam-2321960","kind":"update","title":"15.2.1 Hotfix","summary":"We recently released hotfixes to address some of the most pressing issues that players were facing. Please check the list of fixes below:Fixed the issue with black textures on some Android devices;Fix for the issue causing high memory usage on lower end iOS devices;Solved the crashing issues in the Collections menu caused by scrolling the menu too quickly;The size of the watering can's interaction zone should no longer make it difficult to interact with any other nearby objects;Fix for the issue","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-30T21:01:50Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055886405","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2321960-1838407329256798","game_id":"steam-2321960","kind":"update","title":"15.2 Patch Notes","summary":"Greetings, wanderers!The 15.2 update introduces new social features, changes and improvements to waystations - including the brand new Plots! - resources and economy balancing changes, and more! Check out the list of changes below:Friendship & Social FeaturesPlayer MoodsWhat’s your current vibe? You can now show how you’re feeling or what you’re up to with Moods ✨Select your Mood under its tab in the Character Menu and an icon representing your current mood will appear for other players, so they","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T14:15:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329256798","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2321960-1834602721194083","game_id":"steam-2321960","kind":"announcement","title":"Spirit Crossing’s public playtest is now LIVE on Steam!","summary":"In case you didn’t catch our big announcement during today's Wholesome Direct livestream, we are thrilled to share that Spirit Crossing’s PC playtest is now open to everyone on Steam, for free! Check out the new trailer below. ↓ First, we would like to thank our amazing playtesting community for providing us with immensely valuable feedback and bug reports that made it all possible. As importantly, they have shared beautiful (and amusing) moments with us, and never cease to amaze us with their c","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-06-06T16:08:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1834602721194083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-2321960-1818752592125165","game_id":"steam-2321960","kind":"announcement","title":"Spirit Crossing is coming to Steam!","summary":"As we mentioned to our lovely Cozy Grove community, this is big news for fans of little square bears. (If you aren't familiar, don't worry, we'll introduce you to a couple at the bottom of this announcement.) SO what is Spirit Crossing? Earlier this year, we announced that we were working on a cozy MMO focused on connection. In the time since that announcement, we grew a wonderful community of Alpha players who have been supplying us with endless laughs, beautiful moments, immensely valuable fee","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-11T22:54:18Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592125165","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:02:33Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-2321960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-2321960":"2026-10-26T00:17:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"2321960":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"4422420":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:17:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-2321960","app_id":2321960,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:08Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"3761ee0a10fbaa66f6e21b3251c55cb20290a1ce18d7911b6d473d42935dff51","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Cozy Grove 를 만든 제작진의 신작입니다. 파스텔빛 구름 사이를 유유히 날며 길 잃은 영혼들을 돕고, 산꼭대기 높은 곳에 자리한 나만의 집을 직접 꾸며 보세요. 따뜻한 모닥불 곁에서 낯선 이와 친구가 되거나, 친구와 함께 하늘에서 한가로이 낚시를 하며 추억을 나누세요. 낯설고도 새로운 당신만의 집에 오신 것을 환영합니다. 🏠🏔️","publishers":[{"name":"Spry Fox","creator_clan_account_id":46114641}],"developers":[{"name":"Spry Fox","creator_clan_account_id":46114641}]},"release":{"steam_release_date":1796025600,"is_coming_soon":true,"coming_soon_display":"date_month"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Public Playtest Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1780784745","trailer_category":1,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"2321960/1660099850/c95622be3a38100f9d3985dae3cd42990d9057da/1780784185/microtrailer.webm","type":"video/webm"},{"filename":"2321960/1660099850/c95622be3a38100f9d3985dae3cd42990d9057da/1780784185/microtrailer.